  {
    "type": "domain_knowledge",
    "id": "dk_device_metric",
    "product_area": "device_business",
    "tables": [
      "device_orders"
    ],
    "columns": [
      "order_amount",
      "profit_amount",
      "status",
      "org_code"
    ],
    "text": "设备订货金额仅统计 status='confirmed' 的 order_amount；设备利润统计同一批订单的 profit_amount；所有查询必须显式限定 org_code，金额单位 CNY。"
  },
